ps://timwell.com.my","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Lumber & Wood Production","employees":45,"city":"Kota Kinabalu","summary":"Timberwell Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the forest management, and timber harvesting and trading businesses in Malaysia. It operates through Forestry, Plantation, Trading, and Property divisions. The company is involved in overseeing the timber harvesting and forest regeneration activities; timber marketing and rubber trading; and properties management and investment activities. It also cultivates and plants tree species, including Binuang, Laran, Albizia, Rubber, Mahogany, Durian, and Eucalyptus. Timberwell Berhad was incorporated in 1996 and is based in Kota Kinabalu, Malaysia.","zh":"Timberwell Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，1996年成立，总部位于马来西亚哥打京那巴鲁，在马来西亚从事森林管理、木材采伐和贸易业务。公司通过林业、种植园、贸易和物业四个部门运营。","lines":["林业：负责监督木材采伐和森林再生，并进行木材营销。","种植园：种植和培育多种树种，包括 Binuang、Laran、Albizia、Rubber、Mahogany、Durian 和 Eucalyptus。","贸易：从事橡胶贸易业务。","物业：进行物业管理与投资活动。"],"lines_en":["Forestry: Oversees timber harvesting and forest regeneration, and handles timber marketing.","Plantation: Cultivates and plants tree species including Binuang, Laran, Albizia, Rubber, Mahogany, Durian, and Eucalyptus.","Trading: Engages in rubber trading.","Property: Manages properties and investment activities."]}}